{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And the food shall be for a deposit.</b> Just as a deposit belongs to its owner everywhere, so too this shall be a deposit, guarded for its owners' eating, for the land's need, for the seven years of famine that shall come upon the land of Egypt — so that the land be not cut off by famine, just as the cows did not die in their emaciation."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:26.861854407Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}